{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04775","headline":"送宋休远之蜀任 · 张说","name":"送宋休远之蜀任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"求友殊损益，行道异穷申。\n缀我平生气，吐赠薄游人。\n结恩事明主，忍爱远辞亲。\n色丽成都俗，膏腴蜀水滨。\n如何从宦子，坚白共缁磷。\n日月千龄旦，河山万族春。\n怀铅书瑞府，横草事边尘。\n不及安人吏，能令王化淳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04775.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04775","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}